_:n079107c9b0864c10883b766bd7b524b2b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl#Situation> .
<http://purl.org/spar/datacite/hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
